# Walk the robot base to a named object or place in the scene. Finishes when the base has arrived and stopped; fails if the target is unknown or unreachable.
# Give exactly one of object or place.
# object: name of the object to walk to, as listed in the scene.
# place: name of the place (a piece of furniture) to walk to, as listed in the scene.
string object
string place
---
bool accepted
string run_id
string detail
